OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham urges Welsh Labour to
OL,4,Alisten after historic Senedd election
OL,5,Adefeat
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister will urge Welsh
OL,8,FLabour to "listen" and "take stock"
OL,9,Ffollowing the party's historic defeat
OL,10,Fin May's Senedd elections.
OL,12,FAt a speech at Welsh Labour conference
OL,13,Fin Llandudno, Conwy, Andy Burnham will
OL,14,Fcall on his party to "do things
OL,15,Fdifferently", ahead of the publication
OL,16,Fof a review into what went wrong in
OL,17,FMay.
OL,19,FWelsh Labour leader Ken Skates said the
OL,20,Ffindings were "difficult" and voters
OL,21,Ffelt their support had been taken "for
OL,22,Fgranted".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
