OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham urges Welsh Labour to
OL,4,Alisten after historic Senedd election
OL,5,Adefeat
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour had dominated Welsh politics for
OL,8,Fa century, and until the Senedd
OL,9,Felection had run the Welsh government
OL,10,Fsince the start of devolution.
